			"notes": "Changelog:\n- Split into multiple commands\n  - `/git` runs the git executable. Requires git operator permission in config file.\n  - `/gitadmin` allows you to manage operators and reload the configuration. Requires level 4 operator permissions.\n  - `/gitconfig` allows you to write to your personal gitconfig file.  Requires git operator permission in config file.\n\n- Added suggestions to every command\n- Added a personal configuration system. It will now attempt to load a gitconfig file for each UUID\n  - This can be required via a config option\n\nBeware, this is still a pre-release, but slightly more robust (*slightly more cursed*)."
		},
